# Line endings (team review, 20 Nov 2026, developer 9): LF in the repository for text, CRLF for Windows scripts,
# binaries left alone. Not renormalized on the review's branches: one renormalize commit follows once they are merged.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.pdf binary
*.parquet binary
*.xlsx binary
*.dump binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.zip binary
